      Data: 97|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'Owner-side publish rate in Hz for every synced field: boost, the dodge
        window, the air-state flags and the driver id. Only sends when one of them
        actually changed. Boost, the dodge window and the driver id are predicted
        on every client, so this cadence is what pulls those guesses back onto the
        owner''s values; 0 stops the send entirely.'
